HST Office: Word-style Paragraph dialog. Tabs in Word's order and names ("Indents and Spacing", "Line
and Page Breaks", then Tabs), an alignment list in a General group, and Special (none / First line /
Hanging) + By replacing the first-line field. Line and Page Breaks starts with pagination.

- Special and By only drive the existing first-line field, which stays the single value read and written
  to the items; the field itself still appears for a style's relative (%) or em first line.
- The alignment list exchanges SvxAdjustItem with the Alignment page, which stays as "Advanced Alignment"
  with its justification details, as do Outline & List, Drop Caps, Borders, Area, Transparency and Asian.
- Page ids are unchanged. The tab names are local to this dialog: the same pages keep their general names
  elsewhere.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-writer.py paragraph
